    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="T47n1998A-start">
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a0801.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">乃大書云。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1001.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">"Living is just like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1001.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">Dying is just like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1001.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">Whether there are verses or no verses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1001.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">what is this great heat?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1201.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">The Zen master bestows words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1201.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">earnestly avoiding misinterpretation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1201.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">One must recognize the place of true benefit</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1201.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">in order to attain the Dharma of great freedom, liberation, peace, and joy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1201.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">Lóngxīng Jiǎshēn (the Jiǎshēn year of the Lóngxīng reign),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1201.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">the tenth day of the late summer month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_012-0863a1201.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">written by Zhāng Jùn, the Zǐyán recluse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a20.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">Presented by Yùnwén, the disciple-inheritor Huìrì Chánshī (Zen Master Huìrì), abbot of Jìngshān Néngrén Zen Monastery.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">The master arrived at Xuěfēng, encountering the establishment of a Bodhi assembly, and was invited to give a general discourse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">After the questions were finished, he then said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">"Veteran generals of Bodhi sit within heavy encirclement;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">beyond the kalpa, one sometimes hears the wooden horse neigh;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">not a single inch of blade is used, yet the devil's gall bladder is shattered;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">at the mere sight of the wind, the surrender flag is already raised.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">In the true resting place of the Xuěfēng Dharma cave,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">everyone cherishes a heart of repaying the Buddha and repaying the ancestors;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">each embraces the strategy of pacifying the country and securing the home.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">With wisdom like Śāriputra and eloquence like Pūrṇa Maitrāyaṇīputra,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">Yúnmén arrives today</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">and can only share in tying his tongue.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">However, officials do not allow needles, but privately connect carriages and horses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">Having already arrived here, it cannot be in vain;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">I will briefly borrow the host's majestic light</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">to accord with this season for the great assembly."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">Thereupon, he raised his staff and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">"Do you still know it well?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">The sky is high, the multitude of forms are correct;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">the sea is vast, a hundred rivers flow towards it."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#T47n1998A_CBETA_013-0863a2201.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T14:49:51.324+09:00">He struck once and said again.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
